{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-127266","model_call":38,"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q1644"},"record":{"query":{"op":"next","qid":"q1644"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_25_186084585#4_358402905","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q1644","rank":3,"snippet":"India E-waste Recycling Industry Potential in India Why E-waste Recycling is Important? Licenses & Permission for E-waste Recycling Business in India E-waste Recycling Business Model Investment for E-waste Recycling Business in India 10 Steps for Starting E-waste Recycling Business Next What Business Research Team \" , \"segment\": \"Therefore, the ongoing sale of electronics products provides a lucrative environment for e-waste management in the coming years. Why E-waste Recycling is Important? First of all, e-waste contains a huge amount of <cover>precious metals. And we can use those metals after the recovery from the scrap. Recycling e-waste </cover>helps to manage solid waste effectively. Actually, old electronic devices contain toxic substances such as lead, mercury, cadmium, and chromium. And these are tremendously harmful to the environment. Therefore, proper processing of e-waste is essential. Nowadays, e-waste contributes to more than 70% of the environmental pollution. And only recycling of e-waste can reduce environmental pollution.\" , \"start_char\": 2362.000000 , \"title\": \"How to Start E-waste Recycling Business in India - NextWhatBusiness\" , \"url\": \""},"time":2},"model_calls":38,"document_judgments":33,"relevance_3":16,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
